{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Policy
{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
	<h1 class="flex py-6 pl-5 mx-auto my-auto text-3xl font-bold text-center text-black underline container-fluid">Protection of Personal Data</h1>
	<div class="container flex py-6 mx-auto my-auto ">
		<div class="flex flex-col items-center w-full px-3 md:w-1/1">
			<div class="">
				<div class="">
					<div class="">
						<p class="flex flex-col p-5 m-5 shadow">This policy describes how
							<span class="font-bold">TIBET RESTAURANT</span>
							processes personal data (hereinafter the “Personal Data”) collected from its prospects, customers, and partners (hereinafter the “Customer(s)”):</p>
						<ul class="flex flex-col p-5 m-5 shadow">
							<li>when browsing the website https://catering.hall4all.fr (hereinafter the “Site”) and using its features;
								<a href="#">https://catering.hall4all.fr</a>
							</li>
							<li>when making phone contact;</li>
							<li>as part of contract formalization (signing contracts, etc.) and monitoring these contractual relationships;</li>
							<li>by any other means.</li>
						</ul>
						<p class="flex flex-col p-5 m-5 shadow">The legal references for this policy are the General Data Protection Regulation No. 2016/679/EU of April 27, 2016 – applicable since May 25, 2018 (the “GDPR”) and the amended French Data Protection Act of January 6, 1978 (the “LIL”).</p>
						<p class="flex flex-col p-5 m-5 shadow">This policy may be modified, supplemented, or updated to comply with any legal, regulatory, jurisprudential, or technical changes.</p>
						<p class="flex flex-col p-5 m-5 shadow">However, Personal Data will always be processed in accordance with the policy in effect at the time of collection unless a mandatory legal requirement retroactively dictates otherwise.</p>
						<h2>1. The Personal Data Collected Are As Follows:</h2>
						<ul class="flex flex-col p-5 m-5 shadow">
							<li>On the website https://catering.hall4all.fr/ through contact forms: name, first name, phone number, email address, and any message left by the Customer.</li>
							<li>For commercial prospecting: name, first name, postal address, email address, phone number.</li>
							<li>For contract formalization and monitoring: name, first name, postal address, email address, phone number.</li>
							<li>
								<span class="font-bold">TIBET RESTAURANT</span>
								confirms that it does not collect any "sensitive" data as defined by Article 9, Paragraph 1 of the GDPR (e.g., health data).</li>
						</ul>
						<h2>2. The Main Purposes of the Collected Personal Data:</h2>
						<ul class="flex flex-col p-5 m-5 shadow">
							<li>Allow
								<span class="font-bold">TIBET RESTAURANT</span>
								to respond to Customer inquiries about the services offered.</li>
							<li>Allow Customers to browse and use the Site’s features.</li>
							<li>Enable
								<span class="font-bold">TIBET RESTAURANT</span>
								to send commercial and promotional messages via email, SMS, phone calls, and postal mail.</li>
							<li>Facilitate contract signing and manage contractual relationships.</li>
						</ul>
						<h2>3. Retention of Personal Data</h2>
						<p class="flex flex-col p-5 m-5 shadow">Personal Data is retained for no longer than necessary for commercial engagement, unless a contract is signed, in which case data is retained for up to 5 or 10 years after the contract ends, depending on the nature of the data, unless:</p>
						<ul class="flex flex-col p-5 m-5 shadow">
							<li>The Customer exercises one of their legal rights as detailed below.</li>
							<li>A longer retention period is legally required.</li>
						</ul>
						<h2>4. Security and Confidentiality</h2>
						<p class="flex flex-col p-5 m-5 shadow">
							<span class="font-bold">TIBET RESTAURANT</span>
							implements organizational, technical, and software measures to protect Personal Data against unauthorized access, alteration, or destruction.</p>
						<h2>5. Access to Personal Data</h2>
						<p class="flex flex-col p-5 m-5 shadow">Access to Personal Data is strictly limited to employees of
							<span class="font-bold">TIBET RESTAURANT</span>
							who are bound by confidentiality obligations.</p>
						<h2>6. Customer Rights</h2>
						<ul class="flex flex-col p-5 m-5 shadow">
							<li>Right to access their Personal Data.</li>
							<li>Right to rectify incorrect information.</li>
							<li>Right to data portability and deletion.</li>
						</ul>
						<h2>7. Cookie Policy</h2>
						<p class="flex flex-col p-5 m-5 shadow">Cookies are small text files stored on the Customer's device when visiting the Site. They help enhance browsing and improve the user experience.</p>
						<p class="flex flex-col p-5 m-5 shadow">Customers may disable cookies through their browser settings.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
{% endblock %}
